+"POT-Creation-Date: 2011-05-10 17:48+0200\n"
+"PO-Revision-Date: 2010-12-30 19:25+0200\n"
+"Last-Translator: Joe Hansen <joedalton2@yahoo.dk>\n"
+"Language-Team: Danish <debian-l10n-danish@lists.debian.org>\n"
