+openvpn (2.3.14-debian0) stable; urgency=medium
+
+  * Preparing release of v2.3.14 (Gert Doering, 117dadc)
+  * Correctly state the default dhcp server address in man page (Selva Nair, a1b9e4c)
+  * Map restart signals from event loop to SIGTERM during exit-notification wait (Selva Nair, 4d397fc)
+  * When parsing '--setenv opt xx ..' make sure a third parameter is present (Selva Nair, 290cc3f)
+  * update year in copyright message (Christian Hesse, 64dc639)
+  * Clean up format_hex_ex() (Steffan Karger, 3843024)
+  * Document the --auth-token option (David Sommerseth, d5cb6b4)
+  * Support --block-outside-dns on multiple tunnels (Selva Nair, f65f852)
+  * Repair topology subnet on OpenBSD (Gert Doering, ceac73b)
+  * Repair topology subnet on FreeBSD 11 (Gert Doering, 446ef5b)
+  * Drop recursively routed packets (Lev Stipakov, 748974b)
+  * man: Improve the --keepalive section (David Sommerseth, 2877822)
+
+ -- Samuli Seppänen <samuli@openvpn.net>  Wed, 7 Dec 2016 12:10:00 +0000
+
+openvpn (2.3.13-debian0) stable; urgency=medium
+
+  * Preparing release of v2.3.13 (David Sommerseth, f44354e)
+  * Add a revoked cert to the sample keys (Steffan Karger, bac347d)
+  * Limit --reneg-bytes to 64MB when using small block ciphers (Steffan Karger, a91ddc9)
+  * Fix compilation in pedantic mode (Lev Stipakov, d72c383)
+  * Exclude peer-id from pulled options digest (Lev Stipakov, 8402203)
+  * Fix --multihome for IPv6 on 64bit BSD systems. (Gert Doering, f7aba87)
+  * add POSTINIT_CMD_suf to t_client.sh and sample config (Gert Doering, 7891c8c)
+  * t_client.sh: Add prepare/cleanup possibilties for each test case (David Sommerseth, 6ac1cf1)
