+  * Add unit testing support via cmocka (Jens Neuhalfen, 1739c10)
+  * Update CONTRIBUTING.rst to allow GitHub PRs for code review purposes (Samuli Seppänen, 85f6a2b)
+  * Push an IPv6 CIDR mask used by the server, not the pool's size (Josh Cepek, b8c4684)
