+  * Accept empty password and/or response in auth-pam plugin (Selva Nair, cab48ad4)
+  * Parse static challenge response in auth-pam plugin (Selva Nair, b89e48b0)
+  * Fix tls_ctx_client/server_new leaving error on OpenSSL error stack (Arne Schwabe, 125654bf)
+
