+openvpn (2.4.3-debian0) stable; urgency=high
+
+  * Preparing for release v2.4.3 (ChangeLog, version.m4, Changes.rst) (Gert Doering, db34435)
+  * Fix remotely-triggerable ASSERT() on malformed IPv6 packet. (Gert Doering, ed28cde)
+  * Prevent two kinds of stack buffer OOB reads and a crash for invalid input data (Guido Vranken, 043fe32)
+  * Fix potential double-free in --x509-alt-username (CVE-2017-7521) (Steffan Karger, 0400840)
