+openvpn (2.4.4-debian0) stable; urgency=medium
+
+  * Prepare the release of OpenVPN 2.4.4 (David Sommerseth, 1f45832)
+  * lz4: Move towards a newer LZ4 API (David Sommerseth, 38da61f)
+  * Fix bounds check in read_key() (Steffan Karger, c7e2591)
+  * systemd: Enable systemd's auto-restart feature for server profiles (David Sommerseth, 1c112c3)
+  * tcp-server: ensure AF family is propagated to child context (Antonio Quartulli, b3b7d07)
+  * systemd: Ensure systemd shuts down OpenVPN in a proper way (David Sommerseth, b49c1ca)
+  * OpenSSL: Always set SSL_OP_CIPHER_SERVER_PREFERENCE flag (Szilárd Pfeiffer, a4c5c4b)
+  * Warn that DH config option is only meaningful in a tls-server context (Gert van Dijk, b1298bb)
+  * fragment.c: simplify boolean expression (Antonio Quartulli, 14e4c58)
+  * docs: Replace all PolarSSL references to mbed TLS (David Sommerseth, 1bea2dc)
+  * travis: reorder matrix to speed up build (Steffan Karger, cac73d4)
+  * man: Corrections to doc/openvpn.8 (Richard Bonhomme, b437bf1)
+  * fix a couple of typ0s in comments and strings (Antonio Quartulli, 010ffbe)
+  * tls-crypt: don't leak memory for incorrect tls-crypt messages (Steffan Karger, db52b6d)
+  * route: avoid definition of unused variables in certain configurations (Antonio Quartulli, 3c4e2a3)
+  * Add coverity static analysis to Travis CI config (Steffan Karger, e12d5e3)
+  * crypto: create function to initialize encrypt and decrypt key (Steffan Karger, 9df6a9f)
+  * rename mroute_extract_addr_ipv4 to mroute_extract_addr_ip (Antonio Quartulli, 78b3291)
+  * Use consistent version references (David Sommerseth, 35e81e1)
+  * Highlight deprecated features (David Sommerseth, e710d70)
+  * tls-crypt: introduce tls_crypt_kt() (Steffan Karger, d47228e)
+  * Move run_up_down() to init.c (Steffan Karger, 81b78cf)
+  * remove the --disable-multi config switch (Antonio Quartulli, 12df7c2)
+  * ntlm: avoid breaking anti-aliasing rules (Antonio Quartulli, 30e0778)
+  * Fix socks_proxy_port pointing to invalid data (Thomas Veerman via Openvpn-devel, 76a61ca)
+  * Deprecate --no-replay (Steffan Karger, e3da009)
+  * Deprecate --keysize (Steffan Karger, e2ab495)
+  * sample-plugins: fix ASN1_STRING_to_UTF8 return value checks (David Sommerseth, 5ed5030)
+  * Document down-root plugin usage in client.down (Conrad Hoffmann, 597b622)
+  * Use provided env vars in up/down script. (Conrad Hoffmann, 9f390f0)
+  * Move create_temp_file() out of #ifdef ENABLE_CRYPTO (Steffan Karger, a91c38f)
+  * Always use default keysize for NCP'd ciphers (Steffan Karger, 6f616aa)
+  * add missing static attribute to functions (Antonio Quartulli, d1e18d8)
+  * use NULL instead of 0 when assigning pointers (Antonio Quartulli, a5c2cb6)
+  * remove unused functions (Antonio Quartulli, e096613)
+  * make function declarations C99 compliant (Antonio Quartulli, b5d7474)
+  * OpenSSL: remove unreachable call to SSL_CTX_get0_privatekey() (Antonio Quartulli, a0ee61b)
+  * travis-ci: update pkcs11-helper to 1.22 (Ilya Shipitsin, 9fffbfd)
+  * travis-ci: update openssl to 1.0.2l, update mbedtls to 2.5.1 (Ilya Shipitsin, 14f67c3)
+  * cleanup: Move init_random_seed() to where it is being used (David Sommerseth, 4bd2f4e)
+  * contrib: Remove keychain-mcd code (David Sommerseth, b597ded)
+  * Print ec bit details, refuse management-external-key if key is not RSA (Arne Schwabe, 4b8d654)
+  * ntlm: improve code style and readability (Antonio Quartulli, 8eb2f57)
+  * ntlm: restyle compressed multiple function calls (Antonio Quartulli, 90f2edc)
+  * ntlm: convert binary buffers to uint8_t * (Antonio Quartulli, 3ace113)
+  * cleanup: Move write_pid() to where it is being used (David Sommerseth, cb438b5)
+  * tls-crypt: avoid warnings when --disable-crypto is used (Antonio Quartulli, 8295f62)
+  * management: preserve wait_for_push field when asking for user/pass (Antonio Quartulli, e7ae404)
+  * route: improve error message (Antonio Quartulli, f627202)
+  * fixup: also change missed openvpn_sleep() occurrences (Steffan Karger, 4a04be8)
+  * Move openvpn_sleep() to manage.c (Steffan Karger, 80ece42)
+  * Remove strerror_ts() (Steffan Karger, 5315193)
+  * ntlm: unwrap multiple function calls (Antonio Quartulli, 0bc107b)
+  * ntlm: avoid useless cast (Antonio Quartulli, 527bf0c)
+  * don't print errno twice (Antonio Quartulli, 9a17c4c)
+  * use M_ERRNO instead of explicitly printing errno (Antonio Quartulli, e80af83)
+  * doc: The CRL processing is not a deprecated feature (David Sommerseth, 67e3f02)
+  * Undo cipher push in client options state if cipher is rejected (Steffan Karger, e050c76)
+  * OpenSSL: remove EVP_CIPHER_CTX_free() from the compat layer (Emmanuel Deloget, ebb5c70)
+  * OpenSSL: remove EVP_CIPHER_CTX_new() from the compat layer (Emmanuel Deloget, 0f95758)
+  * travis-ci: add 3 missing patches from master to release/2.4 (Ilya Shipitsin, 5852a03)
+  * Move adjust_power_of_2() to integer.h (Steffan Karger, 8b55a44)
+  * Set tls-cipher restriction before loading certificates (Arne Schwabe, 95c07b1)
+  * crypto: correct typ0 in error message (Antonio Quartulli, d3c0b2b)
+  * Fix typo in extract_x509_extension() debug message (Steffan Karger, c3e6e68)
+  * OpenSSL: remove pre-1.1 function from the OpenSSL compat interface (Emmanuel Deloget, 20884e5)
+
+ -- Samuli Seppänen <samuli@openvpn.net>  Tue, 26 Sep 2017 10:00:00 +0000
