+  * Use lowest metric interface when multiple interfaces match a route (Selva Nair, 965c7906)
+  * Make most registry values optional (Selva Nair, c07bdace)
+  * Ensure strings read from registry are null-terminated (Selva Nair, b00dab54)
+  * show the right string for key-direction (Arne Schwabe, 6725074b)
