+  * Treat dhcp-option DNS6 and DNS identical (Arne Schwabe, 61a72ecd)
+  * Update copyright to include 2018 plus company name change (David Sommerseth, 6da18bf3)
+  * Refactor get_interface_metric to return metric and auto flag separately (Selva Nair, 92b4c0e9)
+  * Plug memory leak if push is interrupted (Steffan Karger, d04032c3)
+  * Document missing OpenVPN states (Simon Rozman, e10f3217)
+  * TLS v1.2 support for cryptoapicert -- RSA only (Selva Nair, 6c54745b)
+  * Add SSL_CTX_get_max_proto_version() not in openssl 1.0 (Selva Nair, f3fd6733)
+  * Add support for TLS 1.3 in --tls-version-{min, max} (Steffan Karger, 59dbb860)
+  * Fix --tls-version-min and --tls-version-max for OpenSSL 1.1+ (Steffan Karger, a25a278c)
+  * Bring cryptoapi.c upto speed with openssl 1.1 (Selva Nair, 94de253e)
+  * Use RSA_meth_free instead of free (Selva Nair, 73bb2a7d)
+  * OpenSSL: check EVP_PKEY key types before returning the pkey (Emmanuel Deloget, 4eae9e51)
+  * travis: use clang's -fsanitize=address to catch more bugs (Steffan Karger, a5dc6465)
+  * travis-ci: add brew cache, remove ccache (Ilya Shipitsin, b968f43f)
+  * ssl_openssl: fix compiler warning by removing getbio() wrapper (Steffan Karger, 041b94c0)
+  * Fix types around buffer_list_push(_data) (Steffan Karger, c4c7f920)
+  * buffer_list_aggregate_separator(): prevent 0-byte malloc (Steffan Karger, ef4b827d)
+  * buffer_list_aggregate_separator(): don't exceed max_len (Steffan Karger, 76fbbd16)
+  * buffer_list_aggregate_separator(): update list size after aggregating (Steffan Karger, 9abfb754)
+  * Fix typo in error message: "optione" -> "option" (Bertrand Bonnefoy-Claudet, 22bffd68)
+  * Return NULL if GetAdaptersInfo fails (Selva Nair, d2b9bd80)
+  * Fix memory leak in buffer unit tests (Steffan Karger, 888204a1)
+  * mbedtls: fix typ0 in comment (Antonio Quartulli, 9df9faeb)
+  * Allow learning iroutes with network made up of all 0s (only if netbits < 8) (Antonio Quartulli, 80614c7c)
+  * reload HTTP proxy credentials when moving to the next connection profile (Antonio Quartulli, fbc50963)
+  * openvpnserv: Add support for multi-instances (Simon Rozman, 8a52d07c)
+  * Use P_DATA_V2 for server->client packets too (Steffan Karger, 6232c7b3)
+  * Fix build with LibreSSL (Jeremie Courreges-Anglas, eac1e089)
+  * Add --tls-cert-profile option. (Steffan Karger, 8bcabf0a)
+  * Remove warning on pushed tun-ipv6 option. (Gert Doering, 81b68821)
+  * buffer_list_aggregate_separator(): add unit tests (Steffan Karger, a202f6e7)
