+  * Fix local #include to use quoted form (Simon Rozman, c6af7006)
+  * Cast time_t to long long in order to print it. (Jeremie Courreges-Anglas, ff857aaa)
+  * autoconf: Fix engine checks for openssl 1.1 (James Bottomley, 7e047e93)
+  * lz4: Rebase compat-lz4 against upstream v1.7.5 (David Sommerseth, dd001c35)
+  * Remove references to keychain-mcd in Changes.rst (David Sommerseth, b98a622b)
+  * Fix missing check for return value of malloc'd buffer (Selva Nair, 9ef03874)
+  * make struct key * argument of init_key_ctx const (Steffan Karger, 94793462)
+  * Avoid illegal memory access when malformed data is read from the pipe (Selva Nair, 17884fa4)
+  * Simplify iphlpapi.dll API calls (Simon Rozman, c5f0ccf1)
+  * RtlIpv6AddressToStringW() and RtlIpv4AddressToStringW() require mstcpip.h (Simon Rozman, 0e91a2dd)
+  * Mixing wide and regular strings in concatenations is not allowed in MSVC. (Simon Rozman, 6e9da5a5)
+  * Local functions are not supported in MSVC. Bummer. (Simon Rozman, 1b49bda5)
+  * lz4: Fix broken builds when pkg-config is not present but system library is (David Sommerseth, c70a80b1)
+  * lz4: Fix confused version check (David Sommerseth, c8a7cc64)
+  * Check whether in pull_mode before warning about previous connection blocks (Selva Nair, 90812e98)
+  * Fix '--bind ipv6only' (hashiz, b0ef0003)
