+  * Add missing #ifdef SSL_OP_NO_TLSv1_1/2 (Simon Matter, 88abb911)
+  * Delete the IPv6 route to the "connected" network on tun close (Selva Nair, 716fdb24)
+  * Correct version in ChangeLog - should be 2.4.5, was mistyped as 2.4.4 (Gert Doering, 161afbeb)
