+  * Preparing release 2.5.2 (Gert Doering, 23ae78e6)
+  * Ensure key state is authenticated before sending push reply (Arne Schwabe, f7b3bf06)
+  * Ensure auth-token is only sent on a fully authenticated session (Arne Schwabe, 3d18e308)
+  * Move auth_token_state from multi to key_state (Arne Schwabe, 3aca477a)
+  * Abort if CRL file can't be stat-ed in ssl_init (Max Fillinger, 8a06459d)
+  * In init_ssl, open the correct CRL path pre-chroot (Max Fillinger, d91c14e8)
+  * Fix condition to generate session keys (Arne Schwabe, 227fbc11)
+  * Move context_auth from context_2 to tls_multi and name it multi_state (Arne Schwabe, 14511010)
+  * Fix IPv4 default gateway with multiple route tables (Vladislav Grishenko, 48ba0b05)
+  * Also restore/save route-gateway options on SIGUSR1 reconnects (Arne Schwabe, 7b594d49)
+  * Fix potential NULL ptr crash if compiled with DMALLOC (Gert Doering, acf52dda)
+  * Always disable TLS renegotiations (Arne Schwabe, a31c4b73)
+  * Cleanup print_details and add signature/ED certificate print (Arne Schwabe, a1773887)
+  * Restore also ping related options on a reconnect (Arne Schwabe, a0e844c8)
+  * openvpnserv: Cache last error before it is overridden (Simon Rozman, 24c1fc2a)
+  * Avoid generating unecessary mbed debug messages (Arne Schwabe, 475d17a5)
+  * Do not print Diffie Hellman parameters file to log file (Richard Bonhomme, c8a72bbf)
