+  * Update IRC information in CONTRIBUTING.rst (Todd Zullinger, 55268c83)
+  * doc link-options.rst: Use free open-source dynamic-DNS provider URL (Richard T Bonhomme, b309f7ea)
+  * Include --push-remove in the output of --help. (Gert Doering, 59a8406e)
+  * Use network address for emulated DHCP server as a default (Lev Stipakov, 93e4f286)
+  * Fix error in example firewall.sh script (Adrian, 6b2c423a)
+  * README.down-root: Fix plugin module name (Ville Skyttä, b01a43e3)
+  * resolvconf fails with -p (Sergio E. Nemirowski, 8fcce504)
+  * Require EC key support in Windows builds (Selva Nair, 6bb4edf4)
