+  * GitHub Actions: use latest working lukka/run-vcpkg (Lev Stipakov, db1a72cc)
+  * contrib/vcpkg-ports: remove openssl port (Lev Stipakov, a0e6707a)
+  * Fix some more wrong defines in config-msvc.h (Selva Nair, c699c0d8)
+  * config-msvc.h: fix OpenSSL-related defines (Lev Stipakov, c93fcb75)
+  * msvc: add missing header to project file (Lev Stipakov, d20a23df)
+  * msvc: fix product version display (Lev Stipakov, d6a9bf5d)
+  * configure: remove useless -Wno-* from default CFLAGS (Antonio Quartulli, 64c96c00)
+  * Fix loading PKCS12 files on Windows (Lev Stipakov, f397c3bf)
+
+ -- Samuli Seppänen <samuli@openvpn.net>  Wed, 15 Dec 2021 08:34:27 +0200
