+openvpn (2.5.8-debian0) stable; urgency=medium
+
+  * Preparing release 2.5.8 (Gert Doering, 0357ceb8)
+  * Do not copy auth_token username to itself (Selva Nair, cd50cf02)
+  * Purge auth-token as well while purging passwords (Selva Nair, 3d792ae9)
