+  * Reduce initialisation spam from verb <= 3 and print summary instead (Arne Schwabe, 75385571)
+  * dco: define OVPN_DEL_PEER_REASON_TRANSPORT_DISCONNECT on FreeBSD (Kristof Provost, 7fdf3e7a)
+  * configure: improve FreeBSD DCO check (Kristof Provost, 86fb085b)
+  * options.c: enforce a minimal fragment size (Kristof Provost, b9a9de15)
+  * Use proper print format/casting when converting msg_channel handle (Arne Schwabe, 27dac506)
+  * Avoid management log loop with verb >= 6 (Lev Stipakov, c26609bd)
+  * configure: fix formatting of --disable-lz4 and --enable-comp-stub (Frank Lichtenheld, 91da6b94)
+  * Windows: fix signedness errors with recv/send (Frank Lichtenheld, e9ae7cee)
+  * Add a unit test for functions in cryptoapi.c (Selva Nair, 094aea56)
+  * Add logging for windows driver selection process (Lev Stipakov, dff1e789)
+  * configure: enable DCO by default on FreeBSD/Linux (Frank Lichtenheld, f63c9b1e)
+  * Disable DCO if proxy is set via management (Lev Stipakov, 42cda5ad)
+  * Exit if a proper message instead of segfault on Android without management (Arne Schwabe, d0c1abb4)
+  * Option --cryptoapicert: support issuer name as a selector (Selva Nair, a8ff15ce)
+  * cryptoapi.c: simplify parsing of thumbprint hex string (Selva Nair, 5a70f502)
+  * cryptoapi.c: remove pre OpenSSL-3.01 support (Selva Nair, f3dd050e)
+  * cyryptapi.c: log the selected certificate's name (Selva Nair, 0ccfce24)
+  * Revise the cipher negotiation info about OpenVPN3 in the man page (Arne Schwabe, cfbfb801)
+  * Add building unit tests with mingw to github actions (Arne Schwabe, adf00ebd)
+  * Improve format specifier for socket handle in Windows (Lev Stipakov, 8e3331a9)
+  * Update the last sections in the man page to a be a bit less outdated (Arne Schwabe, 8cbe09dc)
+  * Combine extra_tun/frame parameter of frame_calculate_payload_overhead (Arne Schwabe, e1fac38c)
+  * dco-win: use proper calling convention on x86 (Lev Stipakov, 3c02417c)
+  * Build unit tests in mingw Windows build (Selva Nair, a6d7e884)
+  * Add missing stdint.h includes in unit tests files (Arne Schwabe, 1b06696e)
+  * Get rid of unused 'bool tuntap_buffer' arguments. (Gert Doering, eca101ac)
+  * Conditionally add subdir-objects option to automake (Selva Nair, 7f72abcf)
+  * Allow certain DHCP options to be used without DHCP server (Lev Stipakov, 442fde78)
+  * Fix LibreSSL not building in Github Actions (Arne Schwabe, dabfebc4)
+  * Windows: fix unused variable in win32_get_arch (Frank Lichtenheld, 4718af50)
+  * Windows: fix wrong printf format in x_check_status (Frank Lichtenheld, 37e23c98)
+  * Windows: fix unused variables in delete_route_ipv6 (Frank Lichtenheld, ab46bdd1)
+  * Windows: fix unused function setenv_foreign_option (Frank Lichtenheld, b9d35055)
+  * block-dns using iservice: fix a potential double free (Selva Nair, a85257e7)
+  * Changes.rst: document removal of --keysize (Frank Lichtenheld, c8e94242)
+  * Add printing USAN stack trace on github actions (Arne Schwabe, 0deb1afd)
+  * Update LibreSSL to 3.7.0 in Github actions (Arne Schwabe, 3973845e)
+  * Fix unaligned access in auth-token (Arne Schwabe, 6241b2f8)
+  * make dist: Ship ovpn_dco_freebsd.h, too (Matthias Andree, 680ba433)
+
+ -- Frank Lichtenheld <frank.lichtenheld@openvpn.net>  Wed, 8 Mar 2023 15:24:53 +0100
