+openvpn (2.6.2-debian0) stable; urgency=medium
+
+  * preparing release 2.6.2 (Gert Doering, 35774425)
+  * Don't overwrite socket flags when using DCO on Windows (Lev Stipakov, cfc5228f)
+  * Parse compression options and bail out when compression is disabled (Arne Schwabe, 5a189d5e)
+  * Add 'allow-compression stub-only' internally for DCO (Arne Schwabe, 2ac91ea7)
+  * Refuse connection if server pushes an option contradicting allow-compress (Arne Schwabe, e950ca1b)
+  * Simplify --compress parsing in options.c (Arne Schwabe, 5fed4be1)
+  * dco-linux: implement dco_get_peer_stats{, multi} API (Antonio Quartulli, 1fd69b90)
+  * Print DCO client stats on SIGUSR2 (Lev Stipakov, d598871c)
+  * dco-freebsd: use m->instances[] instead of m->hash (Antonio Quartulli, 5acefd94)
+  * Make error in setting metric for IPv6 interface non-fatal (Selva Nair, 5babbc78)
+  * Fix '--inactive <time> 0' behavior for DCO (Lev Stipakov, a3c9458d)
+  * dns option: allow up to eight addresses per server (Heiko Hund, 3b967e7e)
+  * multi: don't call DCO APIs if DCO is disabled (Antonio Quartulli, 8f503708)
+  * Improve description of compat-mode (Arne Schwabe, 92827ad8)
+  * dco-linux: remove M_ERRNO flag when printing netlink error message (Antonio Quartulli, 047f772b)
+  * Improve error message on short read from socks proxy (Selva Nair, c20a1584)
+  * Unit tests: add test for SSL_CTX_use_Cryptoapi_certificate() (Selva Nair, 97308374)
+  * Only update frame calculation if we have a valid link sockets (Arne Schwabe, 75cc2fa6)
+  * Make sending plain text control message session aware (Arne Schwabe, da083c3b)
+  * Use key_state instead of multi for tls_send_payload parameter (Arne Schwabe, 31279f71)
+  * using OpenSSL3 API for EVP PKEY type name reporting (Michael Baentsch, a05ec70e)
+  * Support --inactive option for DCO (Lev Stipakov, fd71bce6)
+  * Add a test for signing with certificates in Windows store (Selva Nair, f970ad99)
+  * Refactor SSL_CTX_use_CryptoAPI_certificate() (Selva Nair, 5c2154ca)
+  * Add tests for finding certificates in Windows cert store (Selva Nair, a08d0c77)
+  * Import some sample certificates into Windows store for testing (Selva Nair, e6011868)
+  * Fix memory leaks in HMAC initial packet generation (Arne Schwabe, 0942e157)
+  * Bugfix: Convert ECDSA signature form pkcs11-helper to DER encoded form (Selva Nair, 1e954cef)
+  * Fix memory leaks in open_tun_dco() (Arne Schwabe, be7a5640)
+  * dco: print FreeBSD version (Kristof Provost, 5617f0f0)
+  * dco: print version to log if available (Antonio Quartulli, 9bd6fff7)
+  * dco: don't use NetLink to exchange control packets (Antonio Quartulli, 321b04fa)
+  * tests/unit_tests: Fix 'make distcheck' with subdir-objects enabled (Frank Lichtenheld, 5eb94ce9)
+  * Ensure n = 2 is set in key2 struct in tls_crypt_v2_unwrap_client_key (Arne Schwabe, ae606884)
+  * Set netlink socket to be non-blocking (Arne Schwabe, 35104bdc)
+
+ -- Frank Lichtenheld <frank.lichtenheld@openvpn.net>  Fri, 24 Mar 2023 13:38:58 +0100
