+  * options.c: update usage description of --cipher (Frank Lichtenheld, f45c2c59)
+  * options.c: fix format security error when compiling without optimization (Frank Lichtenheld, cdcaebcb)
+
+ -- Frank Lichtenheld <frank.lichtenheld@openvpn.net>  Thu, 12 Jan 2023 13:32:34 +0100
