+openvpn (2.7.5-debian0) stable; urgency=medium
+
+  * OpenVPN Release 2.7.5 (Gert Doering, b25bb2a8)
+  * Ensure tls-crypt keys are not setup twice (Arne Schwabe, b005e470)
+  * openvpnserv: fix DNS SearchList state pollution on (dis)connect (Lev Stipakov, 1634b42d)
+  * Fix ack_write_buf use after free (Max Fillinger, 5ee1f9b9)
+  * Fix tls_wrap_reneg use after free (Max Fillinger, 3ce0242e)
+  * Ensure we only get the session from valid tokens for external-auth (Arne Schwabe, 010b6c83)
+  * Clean up metadata handling in tls_crypt_v2_extract_client_key (Arne Schwabe, 19c9ad5b)
+  * dco.c: fix argument order in dco_install_key() log string (Ralf Lici, 097d259e)
+  * doc: clarify that --float only applies to UDP (Sami Rusani, c0a54591)
+  * Document --preresolve option (Sami Rusani, 677899c5)
+  * win32: fix plugin trusted-dir check prefix bypass (Lev Stipakov, 7267b93e)
+  * openvpnserv: rework ConvertItfDnsDomains and tests (Heiko Hund, 59113da8)
+  * Make get_random return int64 instead of long (Arne Schwabe, 4558e231)
+  * options: fix use-after-free of DNS options on client connect (Antonio Quartulli, 40a3bc95)
+  * Fix 1-byte buffer overrun on NTLMv2 proxy responses. (Gert Doering, 04309bfe)
+  * dns: Fix memory leak in dns_server_addr_parse (saddamr3e, 7f1d68ae)
+  * Multisocket: use event engine rwflags for UDP I/O (Gianmarco De Gregori, ae508301)
+  * GHA: Switch to using VS 2026 (Frank Lichtenheld, 60e28662)
+  * GHA: Maintenance update June 2026 (Frank Lichtenheld, 993488af)
+  * renovate: Fix typo in regex manager (Frank Lichtenheld, b9989b5c)
+  * Null-terminate tls-crypt client keys when testing (Max Fillinger, 4d22da02)
+  * mudp: send HMAC reset reply synchronously (Antonio Quartulli, dd26557a)
+  * Fix: port-share and multi-socket interaction (Gianmarco De Gregori, 06e71f0c)
+  * Ensure pushed tun-mtu is no lower than TUN_MTU_MIN (Arne Schwabe, b2d92f17)
+  * dco_linux: allow passing KEEPALIVE_TIMEOUT without KEEPALIVE_INTERVAL (Marco Baffo, 4b49192f)
+  * socket: assert buffer length before reading prepended sockaddr family (Lev Stipakov, d849dbd3)
+  * openvpnserv: Fix memory leak when loading DLLs (Frank Lichtenheld, 494e78cc)
+  * openvpnserv: Address some uninitVariable warnings from cppcheck (Frank Lichtenheld, d3eb09b5)
+  * Fix some msg() calls with wrong number of arguments in Windows-only code (Frank Lichtenheld, 815a3bd8)
+  * dco_freebsd: Add check_malloc_return after realloc (Frank Lichtenheld, 1a15b3fa)
+  * DNS server documentation update (Selva Nair, f50d2e14)
+
+ -- Frank Lichtenheld <frank.lichtenheld@openvpn.com>  Wed, 1 Jul 2026 10:17:40 +0200
