+  * Multi-socket: local_list clean-up (Gianmarco De Gregori, 9bb02bc3)
+  * dns: deal with --dhcp-options when --dns is active (Heiko Hund, 2dfc4f82)
+  * fix typo in haikuos dns-updown script (Heiko Hund, 51b7dc5c)
+  * Preserve socket protocol during float processing (Ralf Lici, db9632f7)
+  * dco_linux: enable extended netlink error reporting (Antonio Quartulli, ddbfbeca)
+  * Fix various badly placed comments in preparation for reformat (Frank Lichtenheld, 9cc7c68b)
+  * t_server_null: Test different permutations of --dh (Frank Lichtenheld, 4d104a38)
+  * mbedtls: Allow TLS 1.3 if available (Max Fillinger, abed088c)
+  * Use mbedtls_ssl_export_keying_material() (Max Fillinger, 4c2022ab)
+  * Delete old sample-windows file and obsolete Windows sample handling (Frank Lichtenheld, 1b6b1e33)
+  * Do not segfault on missing --dh in server config (Frank Lichtenheld, 92b9cb5e)
+  * Add missing header in unit tests Makefile.am (Arne Schwabe, c2776ee0)
+  * Update copyright statements to 2025 (Frank Lichtenheld, 022f0a43)
+  * Remove contrib/pull-resolv-conf (Frank Lichtenheld, 26a5c094)
+
+ -- Yuriy Darnobyt <yuriy.darnobyt@openvpn.net>  Wed, 18 Jun 2025 18:34:37 +0200
