+openvpn (2.7~beta1-debian0) stable; urgency=medium
+
+  * OpenVPN Release 2.7_beta1 (Gert Doering, 1e7b9a0f)
+  * PUSH_UPDATE message sender: enabling the server to send PUSH_UPDATE control messages (Marco Baffo, c598efc4)
+  * ssl_openssl: Fix type of sslopts argument to SSL_CTX_set_options (Frank Lichtenheld, 80c5cdef)
+  * options: Introduce atoi_constrained and review usages of atoi_warn (Frank Lichtenheld, a01c909c)
+  * management: stop bytecount on client disconnection (Ralf Lici, fccdb217)
+  * dco_linux: validate tun interface before fetching stats (Ralf Lici, 14ced61e)
+  * dco: avoid printing mi prefix on debug messages (Gianmarco De Gregori, 9e9ba09a)
+  * management: resync timer on bytecount interval change (Ralf Lici, 3bc0b2d0)
+  * Refactor management bytecount tracking (Lev Stipakov, da309c1e)
+  * dco-win: add support for multipeer stats (Lev Stipakov, 6d450085)
+  * forward: Make sure pip flags are treated as unsigned (Frank Lichtenheld, 10476e24)
+  * manage: Make sure various management flags are treated as unsigned (Frank Lichtenheld, cd587865)
+  * socket_util: Clean up conversion warnings in add_in6_addr (Frank Lichtenheld, 84ef4848)
+  * Add new unit test module test_socket (Frank Lichtenheld, 10d64c18)
+  * socket: Create socket_util with non-socket functions (Frank Lichtenheld, cdd61ffb)
+  * Introduce env variables to communicate desired gateway redirection to NM. (Gert Doering, 1cc3525b)
+  * route: Make sure various route flags are treated as unsigned (Frank Lichtenheld, 3671c420)
+  * options: Make sure option types are treated as unsigned (Frank Lichtenheld, 487103a8)
+  * crypto: Make sure crypto flags are treated as unsigned (Frank Lichtenheld, 98dbc8fd)
+  * comp: Make sure comp flags are treated as unsigned (Frank Lichtenheld, 2f6467f7)
+  * Check message id/acked ids too when doing sessionid cookie checks (Arne Schwabe, 518e122b)
+  * Clean up documentation for --tun-mtu-max (Frank Lichtenheld, 5c4744f2)
+  * options: Fix --hash-size virtual argument (Frank Lichtenheld, 4f7ae8ac)
+  * Add sample FFDH parameters file and use that in t_server_null tests (Samuli Seppänen, b60ba20c)
+  * Remove use of 'dh dh2048.pem' from sample configs, remove 'dh2048.pem' file (Gert Doering, 2d735403)
+  * dns: fix systemd dns-updown script (Heiko Hund, 72a0e6f9)
+  * Collect trivial conversion fixes (Frank Lichtenheld, acc8f82f)
+  * GHA: limit 'Deploy Doxygen documentation' to main repo only (Ilia Shipitsin, c4f4f26d)
+  * t_client.sh: Do not wait 3 seconds for OpenVPN to come up (Frank Lichtenheld, db1fd1a8)
+  * buffer: remove unused function buf_write_alloc_prepend (Frank Lichtenheld, 028846f0)
+  * Remove uncrustify config and reformat-all.sh (Frank Lichtenheld, 75f9bd37)
+  * Add clang-format reformat commit to .git-blame-ignore-revs (Frank Lichtenheld, 2cc23415)
+  * clang-format: Switch to ColumnLimit 0 (Frank Lichtenheld, 21f7d6e1)
+  * Fix build error with clang-cl on latest Windows SDK (Frank Lichtenheld, e6db5936)
+  * Reformat the whole project with clang-format (Frank Lichtenheld, 3cca3367)
+  * GHA: enable -Werror for mbedTLS v3 and AWS LC builds (Frank Lichtenheld, c6676716)
+  * Update git-pre-commit-uncrustify.sh to handle clang-format (Frank Lichtenheld, d18f8e4e)
+  * Disable clang-format for some code parts (Frank Lichtenheld, d22f247d)
+  * Define a .clang-format file for the project (Frank Lichtenheld, bba057b0)
+  * Log setting DNS via NRPT (Lev Stipakov, ff371d1a)
+  * Update GPL header in all source files to current recommended version (Frank Lichtenheld, ad73d827)
+  * Update text of GPL to latest version from FSF (Frank Lichtenheld, 63257383)
+
+ -- Yuriy Darnobyt <yuriy.darnobyt@openvpn.net>  Wed, 3 Sep 2025 22:32:15 +0200
