+  * Clean up conversion warnings related to base64_{en, de}code (Frank Lichtenheld, f32844b2)
+  * Handle return type of EVP_MD_size (Frank Lichtenheld, ab20ecee)
+  * ssl_verify: Change backend_x509_* functions to size_t for lengths (Frank Lichtenheld, 38f2cedc)
+  * ssl: Fix -Wconversion warnings in pem_password_callback (Frank Lichtenheld, e256d668)
+  * Fix t_net.sh / networking_testdriver after 'broadcast' change (Gert Doering, 2bb658c8)
+  * Bugfix: Set broadcast address on interface. (Sebastian Marsching, 0df0edc4)
+  * list: Make types of hash elements consistent (Frank Lichtenheld, a69aac41)
+  * Rename Fox Crypto to Sentyron in copyright notices (Max Fillinger, efb58abb)
+  * socket: Change resolve flags to unsigned int (Frank Lichtenheld, 5b7fde23)
+  * Introduce msglvl_t to unify msglevel type handling (Frank Lichtenheld, cc8cd311)
+  * GHA: collect more artifacts for mingw builds (Lev Stipakov, 8465972b)
+  * fix building of openvpnsrvmsg.dll from eventmsg.mc in mingw builds (Gert Doering, 744a2bd5)
+  * openvpnserv: Fix writing messages to the event log (Lev Stipakov, 06919a60)
+  * dev-tools/gerrit-send-mail.py: include Gerrit URL into the commit message (Gert Doering, 16879276)
+  * win: replace wmic invocation with powershell (Lev Stipakov, 5681535b)
+  * manage: Change command_line_* API to use size_t for lengths (Frank Lichtenheld, 5759a838)
+  * events: Make sure rwflags are treated as unsigned (Frank Lichtenheld, e15bb633)
+  * ps: Clean up conversion warnings in journal_add function (Frank Lichtenheld, 3ae25e91)
+  * Switch test_ssl certificate from RSA 2048 to secp384r1 (Arne Schwabe, 456da311)
+  * options: Factor out usages of strtoll and atoll (Frank Lichtenheld, 10c42c74)
+  * ssl_common: Make sure ssl flags are treated as unsigned (Frank Lichtenheld, dd20c79d)
+  * Fix multi-socket and dco-win interaction (Gianmarco De Gregori, 864bb498)
+  * Preserve --dhcp-option values from local config (Lev Stipakov, 3cc7a9eb)
+  * dco: add standard mi prefix handling to multi_process_incoming_dco() (Antonio Quartulli, 531fef40)
+  * remove newline characters at the end of msg() calls (Gert Doering, 340b5b2d)
+  * push-update-server: comment about buf_string_compare_advance() usage in send_single_push_update() (Marco Baffo, c3600e9b)
+  * Multi-socket win: avoid repeated socket_set() (Gianmarco De Gregori, 3b429925)
+  * openvpn_PRF: Change API to use size_t for lengths (Frank Lichtenheld, 6269eb43)
+  * replace assert() calls with ASSERT() (Gert Doering, 88f8edbf)
+
+ -- Yuriy Darnobyt <yuriy.darnobyt@openvpn.net>  Wed, 24 Sep 2025 22:35:52 +0200
diff --git a/debian-sbuild/openvpn/changelog-2.7~beta3 b/debian-sbuild/openvpn/changelog-2.7~beta3
