@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@
+openvpn (2.7~beta3-debian0) stable; urgency=medium
+
+  * OpenVPN Release 2.7_beta3 (Gert Doering, 23a56395)
+  * Make recursive routing check more fine-grained (Lev Stipakov, cf2d18de)
+  * redirect-gateway: only redirect traffic through TUN if address families match (Marco Baffo, 0f9ad850)
+  * test_user_pass: Check fatal errors for empty username/password (Frank Lichtenheld, e7fdde7c)
+  * dhcp: Replace DHCP Option types with defines (Frank Lichtenheld, e03d5384)
+  * Move build_dhcp_options_string from tun to dhcp (Frank Lichtenheld, f63e6c03)
+  * PUSH_UPDATE server: check IV_PROTO before sending the message to the client (Marco Baffo, 85509489)
+  * PUSH_UPDATE server: bug-fix, reset buffer after processing (Marco Baffo, 107f80b8)
+  * socks: Fix conversion warnings with MinGW (Frank Lichtenheld, 083867b0)
+  * console: Simplify query_user_add interface (Frank Lichtenheld, aea7727f)
+  * options: Review use of positive_atoi vs atoi_constrained (Frank Lichtenheld, 7579749f)
+  * Fix PIN cache time in test_pkcs11.c (Selva Nair, f9bfd1c4)
+  * Preserve ifconfig(_ipv6)_local across reconnect (Lev Stipakov, 8a8360fc)
+  * options_util: Fix conversion warning in atoi_constrained (Frank Lichtenheld, 8fd8c4fa)
+  * lzo: Fix conversion warning (Frank Lichtenheld, abb9770f)
+  * test_options_parse: Remove --wrap (Frank Lichtenheld, 8f3e3de7)
+  * proto: Clean up conversion warnings related to checksum macros (Frank Lichtenheld, a06b9b2f)
+  * test_options_parse: Do not use uintmax_t instead of LargestIntegralType (Frank Lichtenheld, 5b8e0563)
+  * GHA: Run options_parse test for MinGW (Frank Lichtenheld, cdbb3e43)
+  * dco-win: support for epoch data channel (Lev Stipakov, ebc9d4bc)
+  * vlan: Remove -Wconversion override (Frank Lichtenheld, 5a042b07)
+  * test_options_parse: Add test for read_config_string (Frank Lichtenheld, 775488b8)
+  * buffer: Fix buf_parse eating input (Frank Lichtenheld, f5a2e231)
+  * test_options_parse: Start new UT for options_parse.c (Frank Lichtenheld, 80981cf3)
+  * crypto: Make some casts to int explicit (Frank Lichtenheld, e0b5ea5d)
+  * PUSH_UPDATE: disabling PUSH_UPDATE server and client if DCO is enabled (Marco Baffo, 373178b3)
+  * Document that tls-crypt-v2 can be used in connection profile (Steffan Karger, 7fa59cdf)
+  * unit_tests: Remove useless wrapping for argv/buffer tests (Frank Lichtenheld, d2428900)
+  * options: Factor out parsing code to separate options_parse.c (Frank Lichtenheld, ebf781b8)
+  * Allow route_ipv6_match_host to be used outside of route.c (Arne Schwabe, 790b8120)
+  * sitnl: Clean up type handling (Frank Lichtenheld, d4993125)
+  * COPYING: Remove licenses for software bundled in the Windows client (Frank Lichtenheld, ce2e5cbc)
+  * dhcp: Fix conversion warnings (Frank Lichtenheld, d446715c)
+  * Review CMocka assertion usage (Frank Lichtenheld, 0e3dd1cc)
+  * mtu: Trivial -Wconversion fix (Frank Lichtenheld, 4fa38979)
+  * Allowing installing FreeBSD routes with interface instead of next-hop (Arne Schwabe, cbcfb9ab)
+  * platform: Do not assume uid_t/gid_t are signed (Frank Lichtenheld, eadae513)
+  * route: Fix a unused-but-set-variable warning on OpenBSD (Frank Lichtenheld, 9243ea88)
+  * crypto_epoch: Clean up type handling in ovpn_expand_label() (Frank Lichtenheld, cb815571)
+  * dco-win: fix broken ASSERT in dco_new_key (Lev Stipakov, 290a14cd)
+  * dco: Change sd argument to dco_new_peer from int to socket_descriptor_t (Frank Lichtenheld, 36a09c8d)
+  * ssl_openssl: Use uint16_t internally for TLS versions (Frank Lichtenheld, 04d24fbe)
+  * dco_linux: Fix -Wconversion warnings (Frank Lichtenheld, b2d5d711)
+  * dco_win: In dco_new_key, document size assumptions for the integer casts (Frank Lichtenheld, e77c3437)
+  * comp-lz4: Fix types in call to LZ4_decompress_safe (Frank Lichtenheld, 2682fb54)
+  * GHA: Dependency updates September 2025 (Frank Lichtenheld, b5ee6fe3)
+
+ -- Yuriy Darnobyt <yuriy.darnobyt@openvpn.net>  Mon, 13 Oct 2025 14:53:43 +0200
diff --git a/debian-sbuild/openvpn/changelog-2.7~rc1 b/debian-sbuild/openvpn/changelog-2.7~rc1
