+
+#~ msgid "Would you like to stop openvpn before it gets upgraded?"
+#~ msgstr "Chcete openvpn při aktualizaci zastavit?"
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "In some cases you may be upgrading openvpn in a remote server using a VPN "
