+ovpn-backports (6.15.0.2025052801-debian0) stable; urgency=medium
+
+  * Generated sources for ovpn-net-next/main-6.15.0-rc5-2025052801 (GitHub Actions, 663d044)
+  * Add missing msg_flags assignment (Ralf Lici, 4bc5978)
+  * Generated sources for ovpn-net-next/main-6.15.0-rc5-2025052800 (GitHub Actions, ece1031)
+  * Improve patch creation tool and usage instructions (Ralf Lici, c16ae72)
+  * Handle MODULE_VERSION in Makefile (Ralf Lici, 80d2af3)
+  * Generated sources for ovpn-net-next/main-6.15.0-rc5-2025052700 (GitHub Actions, 030b633)
+  * Split ovpn.patch into multiple files in compat-patches (Ralf Lici, 7399c56)
+  * GHA: Add monotonically increasing counter to tag (Ralf Lici, c785366)
+  * Generated sources for ovpn-net-next/main-6.15.0-rc5-20250522 (GitHub Actions, 581713f)
+  * Fix typo in README.md: upstream kernel version (Ralf Lici, 7386128)
+  * Fix enum redefinition issues in openSUSE Tumbleweed (Ralf Lici, d1c149e)
+  * Generated sources for ovpn-net-next/main-6.15.0-rc5-20250516 (GitHub Actions, 4b83dcc)
+  * Add ovpn-cli and selftests (Ralf Lici, ac0b053)
+  * Add sources branch and packages info to README (Ralf Lici, a3baa5b)
+  * Update ovpn-net-next to 40d4852 (Ralf Lici, 7b1611c)
+  * Generated sources for ovpn-net-next/main-6.15.0-rc4-20250515 (GitHub Actions, 7ff7081)
+  * GHA: Enable pre-patched source generation for development branch (Ralf Lici, e68234e)
+  * Generated sources for ovpn-net-next/main-6.15.0-rc4-20250514 (GitHub Actions, 0b91b78)
+  * GHA: Fix bad substitution in tag (Ralf Lici, 0a6e457)
+  * Fix missing variables in netlink-gen for RHEL 8.10 (Ralf Lici, 4147d2c)
+  * Align tag format with MODULE_VERSION (Ralf Lici, ed518b6)
+  * Generated sources for v20250513 (GitHub Actions, bc366f1)
+  * GHA: Merge main into sources to unify branch history (Ralf Lici, a5df6b8)
+  * update sources v20250509 (GitHub Actions, 41d2b52)
+  * Fix version conditionals (Ralf Lici, e5ab8b7)
+  * Fix version append issue by deferring kernel deletion (Ralf Lici, 2d65a26)
+  * Update patch and kernel commit (Ralf Lici, e5c4d22)
+  * Set specific ovpn-net-next commit pointer and add MODULE_VERSION (Ralf Lici, b20d8eb)
+  * update sources v20250506 (GitHub Actions, 5b22d91)
+  * Update README (Ralf Lici, f31967d)
+  * Fix incorrect function call in `ovpn_encrypt_post_compl()` (Ralf Lici, 3d7dd00)
+  * Fix compilation warnings (Ralf Lici, dd0d49a)
+  * Improve patch creation tool (Ralf Lici, 6937ff1)
+  * Improve net-next tree handling for `get-ovpn -k` and update repository (Ralf Lici, 24a218c)
+  * update sources v20250505 (GitHub Actions, d3c0678)
+  * Fix netlink message parsing on kernels < 5.5 (Ralf Lici, 42a1c20)
+  * update sources v20250430 (GitHub Actions, dd28ad5)
+  * Reorder patched files alphabetically and add patch regeneration tool (Ralf Lici, 5509439)
+  * Update version conditionals to include patch-level updates (Ralf Lici, 99ef27b)
+  * Fix missing stats on kernels < 6.9 (Ralf Lici, a53a8e8)
+  * Fix crypto_completion_t callback data access (Ralf Lici, 0815d1b)
+  * Remove unused `REVISION` variable from Makefile (Ralf Lici, fdbc7e0)
+  * Remove redundant check on `get-kernel` command (Ralf Lici, a490973)
+  * Fix tstats uninitialized in kernel version < 6.9 (Ralf Lici, ef27c37)
+
+ -- Frank Lichtenheld <frank.lichtenheld@openvpn.net>  Wed, 28 May 2025 12:24:53 +0000
